{"title":"장난 센세이션","artist":"삼라만상","sourceId":"reference:5S23Cj8ItBPl3BzwiwpH","sourceHash":"89cbfd8d738a054f8b3a6d7e223c7c083f6bb3a5449588c1eca9018fe7d4448c","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lyric_character_matching","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":1.28,"end":3.52,"text":"Vamp 紅魔!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":3.6,"end":6.0,"text":"Jump 紅魔!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":6.06,"end":8.74,"text":"全部全部 搾り取って soul [ソウル]！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":8.8,"end":11.16,"text":"イタズラ everynight [エブリナイ]！！！！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":12.68,"end":16.58,"text":"I want you night [アイウォンチュナイ]","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":17.84,"end":21.22,"text":"啓蒙して 洗脳して かしづいて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":21.78,"end":23.78,"text":"じゃんじゃかのじゃん","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":24.54,"end":29.6,"text":"私がこの屋敷の 主の紅い月よ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":29.7,"end":32.34,"text":"どうぞいらして 硬くならずに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":32.34,"end":34.36,"text":"お座りになったら？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":34.76,"end":35.86,"text":"私の番！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":35.9,"end":38.54,"text":"ダダダ大好物はね人間（冗談）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":38.54,"end":41.0,"text":"姉のご自慢の天使（Yeah!）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":41.12,"end":43.52,"text":"早く遊ぼう！何をして過ごそう！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":43.58,"end":46.08,"text":"（楽しい）嬉しい 待てない！！！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":46.28,"end":47.1,"text":"（えっへへ）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":47.58,"end":50.86,"text":"吸血鬼ごっこはお好き？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":50.96,"end":54.84,"text":"鬼さんこちらよ(LaLaLa…♪)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":54.94,"end":57.58,"text":"なんでもいいわよ（わーたーしーはー♪）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":57.66,"end":58.66,"text":"お客様…？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":60.28,"end":62.6,"text":"（ああ？）かごめかごめをやりたいな！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":62.66,"end":65.04,"text":"（ちょっと！）あなたがもちろん籠の役？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":65.12,"end":67.9,"text":"まって！ああ　ああ　ああ　ああ　ああ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":68.02,"end":70.48,"text":"はっとなって　きゅっとしてドッカーン！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":70.48,"end":71.58,"text":"行くよー","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":71.72,"end":72.96,"text":"運命 絡ませて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":72.96,"end":76.24,"text":"姉妹の究極『ファイブオブアカインド』キラめいて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":76.26,"end":78.08,"text":"もう逃げられはしない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":78.08,"end":81.44,"text":"迷子になって着いたあなたが悪いのよっ！ね！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":81.44,"end":82.96,"text":"ランタンを灯したら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":83.0,"end":86.54,"text":"全て見せて 貴方の手札で遊びたい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":86.54,"end":88.06,"text":"二人のお相手して","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":88.06,"end":91.82,"text":"今日は絶対お家に帰しては あげません！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":91.88,"end":94.22,"text":"Vamp 紅魔!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":94.22,"end":96.74,"text":"Jump 紅魔!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":96.78,"end":99.2,"text":"全部全部　飲み干して　come!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":99.26,"end":101.82,"text":"メチャクチャ　バラバラ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":101.82,"end":103.04,"text":"いけないんだ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":103.12,"end":105.6,"text":"動かなくなっちゃったじゃん！（えー）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":105.64,"end":107.96,"text":"先生にチクっちゃおう！（けいね…？）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":107.96,"end":113.22,"text":"お姉さまがすんごく高いところから落としたからね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":113.22,"end":115.48,"text":"（ムシャクシャして　つい）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":116.74,"end":117.78,"text":"ちょい待ち！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":117.78,"end":119.92,"text":"鬼がかった高火力で（わかんない）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":119.94,"end":122.72,"text":"おなたが押したからでしょう？（聞こえない）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":122.72,"end":128.04,"text":"いつもいつでも　聞き分けのない　本当に妹なの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":128.04,"end":129.0,"text":"なんなの？！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":129.0,"end":132.9,"text":"嗚呼いつもいつもそう私が悪いの？！（lurara…）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":132.92,"end":138.42,"text":"今日までもずっと我慢してたの（我慢してた？）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":138.42,"end":141.54,"text":"とんでもないわ 嘘ばかり（あーもう…）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":141.54,"end":143.02,"text":"我慢してたのこっちの方！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":143.06,"end":146.22,"text":"あーもう！もう もう もう もう もう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":146.22,"end":148.78,"text":"カッとなってキィィィってなってドッカーン！！！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":148.78,"end":149.46,"text":"もう知らない！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":149.46,"end":150.92,"text":"全部気に入らないわ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":150.92,"end":154.62,"text":"ああお姉さま 私なんにも悪くないもん！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":154.62,"end":156.04,"text":"反省しなさいな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":156.06,"end":159.72,"text":"一日中　ぎゃーぎゃー騒いでいたのはだあれ？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":159.72,"end":160.94,"text":"生意気マジ勘弁！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":160.94,"end":164.36,"text":"忘れないで ホントは怖がってたくせに！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":164.36,"end":166.16,"text":"話をすりかえないで！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":166.16,"end":170.0,"text":"今日は絶対許さないんだからね　嫌い嫌い嫌い嫌い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":170.0,"end":171.32,"text":"「咲夜がいないと何もできないくせに！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":171.32,"end":172.42,"text":"「それはフランあなたもでしょ？！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":172.42,"end":175.32,"text":"「カリスマがどーとかこーとか言ってるけど全然なにそれ？って感じ！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"66","start":175.32,"end":177.8,"text":"「あなたなんかただ力が強いだけでしょ！この怪力娘！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"67","start":177.8,"end":178.62,"text":"「何よ！」「何なの？！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"68","start":178.62,"end":180.28,"text":"大 大 大 嫌い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"69","start":180.3,"end":188.54,"text":"（ハイハイハイ…）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"70","start":188.54,"end":189.84,"text":"1.2.3.4！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"71","start":189.86,"end":192.46,"text":"毎日毎日","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"72","start":192.5,"end":194.64,"text":"飽きずに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"73","start":194.68,"end":197.42,"text":"お遊戯 喧嘩を（猫も杓子も　寸暇惜しんで）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"74","start":197.42,"end":198.58,"text":"懲りずに（されば今日とて）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"75","start":199.92,"end":201.06,"text":"遊ぼ？（ハイハイ）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"76","start":201.06,"end":202.22,"text":"遊ぼ！（ハイハイ）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"77","start":202.22,"end":207.38,"text":"さん さん  さざん 散々な態度 全然 ぜぜん アホは治らぬ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"78","start":207.44,"end":209.7,"text":"同じアホなら踊らにゃそんそん","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"79","start":209.72,"end":212.38,"text":"仲良く楽しまにゃ 損よ…","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"80","start":215.14,"end":217.38,"text":"今日も今日とてでハイハイハイハイハイハイ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"81","start":217.38,"end":218.54,"text":"仲直りしましょう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"82","start":218.58,"end":221.92,"text":"いやよ私 なんにも悪くなんてないもん","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"83","start":221.92,"end":223.74,"text":"二人で一つじゃない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"84","start":223.74,"end":227.22,"text":"もう顔だって見たくもないくらい大嫌い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"85","start":227.22,"end":228.64,"text":"あなたが大切なのよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"86","start":228.64,"end":231.86,"text":"それは本心？私だってだってホントは…","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"87","start":231.86,"end":233.38,"text":"遊びのお相手なら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"88","start":233.38,"end":237.56,"text":"やっぱりそうよ　二人で一つなの クランベリー","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"89","start":237.56,"end":238.66,"text":"Vamp 紅魔！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"90","start":238.66,"end":239.94,"text":"（ちょちょいのちょい）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"91","start":239.94,"end":242.26,"text":"『ファイブオブアカインド』キラめくキララ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"92","start":242.26,"end":243.3,"text":"R.I.P 紅魔！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"93","start":243.3,"end":244.74,"text":"（ ニニンガシ ハイ）一緒に遊んで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"94","start":244.74,"end":247.24,"text":"いこうじゃないか みんなでラララ（ラララ）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"95","start":247.24,"end":248.5,"text":"アウト！セーフ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"96","start":248.5,"end":249.58,"text":"（十字架ラッシュ）そんなものなんて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"97","start":249.6,"end":251.92,"text":"効きはしないわ、ねぇ？ねぇ？ねぇ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"98","start":251.92,"end":254.76,"text":"運命は変えられない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"99","start":254.76,"end":260.8,"text":"コンティニューすらもできない！できないの！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}